{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:44 2026-10-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:44 2026-10-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:44 2026-10-07 HKT</p><p>今晚快活谷第二場四班千二米，楊明綸策騎鄭廄的「新力」以九點九倍半冷獨贏後上取勝。</p><p>賽後鄭俊偉說：「『新力』能夠取勝，真非常感謝我的馬房團隊，因為大家齊心協力為牠做了不少備戰工夫。其實此馬今仗之勝也非常幸運，因牠報名時原被列為後備一，但最終能夠以正選馬身分出賽，很高興能夠為牠取得勝利。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47501252bde4d43826d69d8b56ea1f25/2026-10/0ddf3588-ff93-4f25-a8b0-2384f085a6e6.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa08f3212beff15f0602c50d5bf3cb6b/2026-10/0e600005-1f4a-489e-a315-5e072c64b765.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eaf7c76674974365410b119a396c5959/2026-10/1fc54c87-6a68-4a81-bfc3-a1fff0ee1378.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21607517b1209ebece4ca95da58ee907/2026-10/5db7d67a-4a71-43ae-ab1c-a014bbc0127d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/693dd2c16a5cd3b49410060e3121f1e0/2026-10/9cffab05-8307-48a7-b78d-132aea538e2f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edb7f11bd6f168e3c316b3634b7c5114/2026-10/607c9365-5b7a-441d-85d0-39dc158f9c78.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42b74fd701bbc07f1440489a8becce80/2026-10/808b56e2-3ac5-40fb-9527-0deed482be05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/762200a0c737b7d2c8c485825f8366ef/2026-10/3306cbba-5a56-4d61-b712-36bada4fafe8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f18d12324dc5dbae4bedd58f9e11e0d/2026-10/0238987b-4860-4aff-9c82-ff7429f6d3d1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3727c0ba3c1a24ac41ef0606e9c61bfd/2026-10/cf6db408-4799-4fc4-b93d-a08eadda7e33.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b126bca9b3ebfe005d709dd41fee17d9/2026-10/cf68f399-30b1-4f57-bc1c-50cdf670fee3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/424b233f5d81076ca4663e8459079a05/2026-10/f0424362-5601-4e69-9ec3-509e62344b8a.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\